OL,3,GNEWSABaby death suspects released on
OL,4,Abail
OL,5,
OL,6,FTwo people arrested in connection with
OL,7,Fthe death of a one-year-old girl in
OL,8,FWarwickshire have been released on
OL,9,Fbail, police say.
OL,11,FIt comes after emergency services were
OL,12,Fcalled to a house on Long Street,
OL,13,FAtherstone, at about 11:50 BST on
OL,14,FFriday to reports of a child in cardiac
OL,15,Farrest. She was pronounced dead at the
OL,16,Fscene a short while later, police said.
OL,18,FA 19-year-old woman and a man aged 21
OL,19,Fwere then both arrested at the scene on
OL,20,Fsuspicion of child neglect.
OL,23,APub: 13-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
